/* The Check-in: the Worker's settings (chat B, 4 Nov 2026). Its own Worker, its own D1 database and its own
   Durable Object class, so a deploy here never touches the find-outs (logicers-findout, logicers-findout-room)
   or the live games (logicers-live). Khayyam connects it once, the same way as logicers-findout (README.md):
   in Cloudflare's dashboard a Worker named logicers-checkin connected to the GitHub repository with the root
   directory server/checkin and the watch path server/checkin/*; Workers Builds reads this file and runs
   "npx wrangler deploy" on every push that changes the folder.
   Before the first deploy, one thing is made by hand: the D1 database (Storage & Databases, D1, Create: name
   logicers-checkin), and its id is pasted below. The tables make themselves on the first request; the Durable
   Object class Room is made by the migration below on the first deploy.
   Secrets, set once in the dashboard (Settings, Variables and Secrets), never here:
     ADMIN_KEY         a long password of your own (32 random characters or more): the CSV export
     TURNSTILE_SECRET  the Turnstile widget's secret key; while it is unset, uploads are taken without a token
                       and /health says "turnstile": false
     ROOM_HASH_SECRET  a second long password of your own: the key of the room hash in the research rows, so
                       nobody who had a room's code or tag can find its rows in a published file; while it is
                       unset, ADMIN_KEY stands in (/health says "room_hash": "secret" | "admin" | "plain")
   Plain variables: ALLOW_ORIGINS, the sites that may call (add "localhost" only while testing a page on your own
   computer, and take it out again);
   JOIN_URL and HOST_URL, the links the server hands out ({code} and {key} are filled in): change them here if
   the section's folder gets another name.
   Workers Logs and traces stay OFF: nothing else is kept. */
{
  "$schema": "./node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "logicers-checkin",
  "main": "src/worker.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-01",
  "workers_dev": true,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "observability": { "enabled": false, "logs": { "enabled": false, "invocation_logs": false } },
  "triggers": { "crons": ["23 * * * *"] },
  "vars": {
    "ALLOW_ORIGINS": "https://logicers.com",
    "JOIN_URL": "https://logicers.com/checkin/room/#{code}",
    "HOST_URL": "https://logicers.com/checkin/host/#{key}"
  },
  "d1_databases": [
    { "binding": "DB", "database_name": "logicers-checkin", "database_id": "ac533f8a-032e-4950-9138-f8d9a38125a5" }
  ],
  "durable_objects": {
    "bindings": [{ "name": "ROOM", "class_name": "Room" }]
  },
  "migrations": [
    { "tag": "v1", "new_sqlite_classes": ["Room"] }
  ]
}
